# The sdist ships the test suite, so it has to ship all of it.
# setuptools' default only picks up files named `test*.py`, which leaves
# out `tests/__init__.py` (so the relative imports fail) and
# `tests/grampsdtd.py` (the DTD matcher the schema tests import).
recursive-include tests *.py

# The vendored Gramps DTD is a test fixture the DTD-gate tests read.
include tests/data/grampsxml.dtd
include tests/data/README.md
